  "description": "The Subway model has it all, fully sealed bike with all the trimmings. Frame comes with removable brake hardware and is fully sealed throughout. Bigger bars, Pivotal Seat, top load stem and Chad Kerley's signature tires. The Midway is perfect for any style of riding, street, park and or dirt.\nPremium Crmo downtube frame with integrated head tube, Mid BB shell, integrated seat clamp and removable brake and cable mounts - 20.5\" or 21\" top tube\nInternal threaded crmo steer tube fork with hi-ten tapered legs\n8.75\" (on 20.5\") or 9\" (on 21\") with Premium top load stem\nPremium Team grips\nThree-piece crmo 175mm 8-spline cranks with sealed Mid BB\n25/9 gearing\nFully sealed wheels with Alienation PBR rims\nPremium CK tires 2.4\" front and rear\nPremium Fat Capitol Pivotal seat\nPremium Kinetic plastic pedals",
